Outbound delivery is triggered from `server/router/api/v1/memo_service_webhooks.go`, which calls `webhook.PostAsync()`. That enqueues payloads; worker goroutines started in `init()` in `internal/webhook/webhook.go` call **`Post`**, which performs the HTTP POST via `safeClient.Do(req)`:

